cff-version: 1.2.0

message: "If you use PyStormTracker in research, please cite the preferred citation and the software."

title: "PyStormTracker: A High-Performance Cyclone Tracker in Python"
type: software

abstract: >-
  PyStormTracker is an open-source Python package for high-performance
  cyclone detection, trajectory construction, comparison, and storm-track
  analysis in gridded meteorological data.

authors:
